 "id": 31389,
 "title": "Bound to a Prisoner",
 "slug": "bound-to-a-prisoner",
 "platform": "miraluneshort",
 "episodes": 60,
 "cover": "https://dramadog.app/c/31389.webp",
 "description": "Kane is a mechanic who watched his father and brother murdered before his eyes—and then went to prison for it. The killer left fingerprints behind, and those fingerprints belonged to Kane. Life without parole. He spends his years inside hardening himself, learning to fight, learning to read people, learning to wait. When he finally gets out, he takes a job as bodyguard to Luka, heir to a shipping empire. It isn't charity—Kane is using the company's books to hunt the man who framed him: Adrien. What he doesn't expect is that Luka is hunted too. His father's death was ruled a heart attack, but Luka knows better, and he is chasing the same family at the center of Kane's blood debt. They save each other's lives through staged duels, kidnappings, and gunfire. Suspicion turns into partnership, partnership into something neither of them names until it's too late to deny. The trail leads to one conclusion: Luka's uncle Grant and cousin Adrien ordered both murders, erasing two families to take control of the shipping line. A former comrade of Kane's, Damon, coerced by jealousy and a theft he can't hide, is forced to help the killers close in. Kane confesses why he really came to Luka—not for love, but for revenge. Luka chooses to stand with him anyway, and offers his own secrets in return, including the underground deals he'd rather forget. When Adrien uses corrupt prison guards to launch an ambush, Kane is gravely wounded, and Luka fights back hard enough to turn the tide. In the end, the evidence survives, their names are cleared, and Grant and his son stand trial. Luka answers for his own crimes. Released and free, they walk away from the shadows—and start a new life together inside a legitimate shipping company, with nothing left to run from.",
 "about": "Bound to a Prisoner is an English short drama in 60 episodes, originally released on MiraluneShort. It falls under Bodyguard & Protector, Second Chance, Heir & Heiress and Revenge. Viewers on MiraluneShort rate it 8.7 out of 10. Every episode is free to watch on DramaDog, with no app or sign-up.",
