 "cover": "https://dramadog.app/c/30963.webp",
 "description": "Elena and Julian shared a decade-long love from school uniforms to wedding gowns. She devoted herself fully to supporting her husband, reviving the declining Sterling Group and helping it integrate into the elite Wall Street business circle. During a road trip across Nevada, Julian suffered a car crash and lost his memory. He mistook scheming Isabella for his life savior and brought her back to Manhattan, sheltering her lavishly. Isabella even used a fake pregnancy test report to force her way into their family. To protect the so-called child in Isabella’s womb, manipulated by her, Julian abused his spousal medical decision-making right. Working with a private hospital in Beverly Hills, he signed papers without hesitation to force Elena into a hysterectomy. Seeing his signature on the surgery consent form, Elena’s heart died completely. She set a seven-day countdown to settle all affairs. On the final day, she left the divorce agreement in their marital home, arranged to head for a mysterious island with her best friend, and vanished without a trace. Later, Julian uncovered the truth that Isabella had forged all medical records. He searched all across America frantically for his lost wife. Meanwhile on the remote island, Elena rescued a man who drifted ashore after a sea accident — Alexander, the wealthiest tycoon in the whole country. Warm and considerate, Alexander healed Elena’s deep wounds and always stood firmly by her side amid endless schemes and frame-ups from vain socialites. Elena regained hope and discovered a rare physical miracle of double uterus at a top medical clinic, successfully conceiving Alexander’s heir. Months later, a sensational century wedding was held at a private manor on Long Island. Julian tracked down Elena’s whereabouts and broke into the grand ceremony with the crippled Isabella, begging her to reconcile with their decade of past affection. As Julian knelt down weeping and Isabella frantically rushed toward Elena’s pregnant belly, Alexander presented complete bankruptcy liquidation documents targeting their family enterprises. Elena stood tall and revealed her hidden identity — Q, the most mysterious top-tier hacker feared by everyone on Wall Street. Alexander proclaimed to the whole world that his woman deserves the supreme glory and status above all else.",
