 "description": "In a rigidly stratified orc world, Noah, a timid, sweet F‑rank rabbitfolk, is sent to the auction block by his master Julian as punishment. Written off as worthless by everyone, he is bought for ten million dollars by Adrian Moretti, the powerful, enigmatic mafia don. Hoping to get kicked out of the manor quickly, Noah tries everything to misbehave: wrecking the study, stirring up trouble, and deliberately testing Adrian’s patience. Yet no matter what mischief he makes, the fearsome don never grows angry. Instead, he indulges and dotes on him endlessly. When a little rabbit desperate to escape meets a mafia don determined to claim him, a tender love story full of contrasting charm, sweet tension and healing redemption begins. Thrown into the auction like trash by his former owner, when will the little rabbit realize that the dreaded mafia don will never bear to see him hurt?",
