 "description": "Pei Jin was the most gifted young swordsman of the Qingyun Sect — until the night his senior brother Ling Xiao tore the sword heart out of his chest and left him dying in the snow. He wakes up in a body that should be dead, in a sect where he is nothing but a servant sweeping the courtyard. No cultivation. No sword. No name that anyone respects. Only one thing survived the night: he remembers everything. So he starts again from the bottom — hiding his rebirth behind a servant's broom, reading the sect's ledgers by candlelight, letting every man who ever mocked him swing first. Every humiliation is a move on a board only he can see. Ling Xiao took a heart that was never his; Pei Jin intends to take back the life that was never given. But the sword heart is only the first debt. Behind Ling Xiao stands the Heaven Sword Court, and behind the Court lies a twenty-year-old secret: the massacre of the Jiang clan, a sealed tomb at Sword Scar Plain, and a scabbard that remembers a master the world was told to forget. The girl who keeps saving his life, Jiang Qingyao, is the last living thread of that erased name. Forty-five episodes. One reborn servant, one stolen heart, one debt at a time — until the day the sword chooses its true master and the whole sect has to kneel to a name they burned.",
