 "cover": "https://dramadog.app/c/27359.webp",
 "description": "\"Xu Ruoxi was the silent power behind Norce Group, she inherited but kept hidden to build a quiet life with the man she loved. She poured everything into her husband, artist Jiang Xubai—her fortune, her future, her trust. When she finally prepared to reveal her true identity, she walked into their home to find him in the arms of his scheming assistant, Su Zhixia. Worse followed. Su Zhixia orchestrated a brutal kidnapping, beat Xu Ruoxi until she miscarried, and left her bleeding out on a cold floor. When Ruoxi called her husband for help, he hung up. That was the last time she ever needed him. She walked away from the marriage and reclaimed her birthright. Norce Group answered to her now. And without her quiet fortune propping him up, Jiang Xubai’s career crumbled overnight. His exhibitions flopped. His name turned to ash. Then he discovered the truth: the wife he abandoned was the tycoon he’d spent years trying to impress. Worse, the child he ignored—the daughter he never knew—was murdered by the woman he’d chosen over his own family. Now Jiang Xubai is a man undone. He begs. He follows. He tears through his dwindling fortune trying to win back the woman who no longer sees him. But Xu Ruoxi is not the woman he discarded. She has rebuilt her life beside Shen Yizhou, the gentle vice chairman who loved her without conditions. She holds the power he once took for granted. And when Su Zhixia is finally arrested for her crimes, when Jiang Xubai loses his sight and his freedom, Xu Ruoxi watches him fade into the obscurity he deserves—with her empire intact, her heart finally free, and a future she chose for herself. A story of a woman who was invisible until the day she decided to be seen—and the man who realized too late that he had thrown away the only thing that ever made him matter.\"",
